    "en": {
      "rota": "en/under-discussion",
      "frase": "Portugal had 431,35 practising physicians per hundred thousand inhabitants in 2024, between Belgium, with the lowest value (334,25), and Greece, with the highest (626,89), among the twenty-six member states with 2024 data; Slovakia has none.",
      "pedidos": "Outside the table, in the risks chapter, the report counts 2 388,2 million euros in financial rebalancing claims and litigation by road concessionaires and subconcessionaires, with data referenced to 1st quarter of 2026, 1 140 above the previous report, including 1 122,5 from Brisa, in the ongoing negotiation, and 445 in the main action by Rotas do Algarve Litoral, in which Infraestruturas de Portugal pays, by provisional decision, around 1,3 million a month, plus VAT. The UTAO distinguishes claims from actual charges: «São pretensões dos parceiros privados, e não encargos já reconhecidos; a sua concretização, total ou parcial, oneraria o saldo orçamental de anos futuros.»",
      "html": "In the European comparison, Portugal spent <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-pt-2024\" class=\"claim-value\">10,20</span><span class=\"claim-sufixo\"> %</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-pt-2024\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span> of GDP on health in <a class=\"discussao-periodo\" data-discussao-periodo=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-pt-2024\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-pt-2024\"><span class=\"data-da-linha\" data-nonledger=\"data-da-linha\" data-de-linha=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-pt-2024\" data-de-campo=\"reference_date\">2024</span></a>, the EU <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-eu27_2020-2024\" class=\"claim-value\">10,16</span><span class=\"claim-sufixo\"> %</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-tot_hf-eu27_2020-2024\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span>; per inhabitant, in current euros and without correction for price levels, <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-eur_hab-tot_hf-pt-2024\" class=\"claim-value\">2 764,83</span><span class=\"claim-sufixo\"> euros</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-eur_hab-tot_hf-pt-2024\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span> against <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-eur_hab-tot_hf-eu27_2020-2024\" class=\"claim-value\">4 074,88</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-eur_hab-tot_hf-eu27_2020-2024\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span> in the EU; in government schemes and compulsory contributory schemes alone, <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-hf1-pt-2024\" class=\"claim-value\">6,31</span><span class=\"claim-sufixo\"> %</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-hf1-pt-2024\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span> of GDP against <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-hf1-eu27_2020-2024\" class=\"claim-value\">8,17</span><span class=\"claim-sufixo\"> %</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-hlth-sha11-hf-a-pc_gdp-hf1-eu27_2020-2024\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span>. Portugal had <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-pt-phys\" class=\"claim-value\">431,35</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-pt-phys\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span> practising physicians per hundred thousand inhabitants in <a class=\"discussao-periodo\" data-discussao-periodo=\"eurostat-pt-phys\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-pt-phys\"><span class=\"data-da-linha\" data-nonledger=\"data-da-linha\" data-de-linha=\"eurostat-pt-phys\" data-de-campo=\"reference_date\">2024</span></a>, between Belgium, with the lowest value (<span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-be-phys\" class=\"claim-value\">334,25</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-be-phys\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span>), and Greece, with the highest (<span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"eurostat-el-phys\" class=\"claim-value\">626,89</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-el-phys\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Eurostat\" title=\"Eurostat\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span>Eurostat</span></span></a></span>), among the twenty-six member states with <a class=\"discussao-periodo\" data-discussao-periodo=\"eurostat-pt-phys\" href=\"/en/ledger/eurostat-pt-phys\"><span class=\"data-da-linha\" data-nonledger=\"data-da-linha\" data-de-linha=\"eurostat-pt-phys\" data-de-campo=\"reference_date\">2024</span></a> data; Slovakia has none.",
      "html_pedidos": "Outside the table, in the risks chapter, the report counts <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"ppp-oe2027-riscos-pedidos-rodoviarios\" class=\"claim-value\">2 388,2</span><span class=\"claim-sufixo\"> million euros</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/ppp-oe2027-riscos-pedidos-rodoviarios\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Ministério das Finanças\" title=\"Ministério das Finanças\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span lang=\"pt-PT\">Ministério das Finanças</span></span></a></span> in financial rebalancing claims and litigation by road concessionaires and subconcessionaires, with data referenced to <a class=\"discussao-periodo\" data-discussao-periodo=\"ppp-oe2027-riscos-pedidos-rodoviarios\" href=\"/en/ledger/ppp-oe2027-riscos-pedidos-rodoviarios\"><span class=\"data-da-linha\" data-nonledger=\"data-da-linha\" data-de-linha=\"ppp-oe2027-riscos-pedidos-rodoviarios\" data-de-campo=\"period\">1st quarter of 2026</span></a>, <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"ppp-oe2027-riscos-acrescimo\" class=\"claim-value\">1 140</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/ppp-oe2027-riscos-acrescimo\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Ministério das Finanças\" title=\"Ministério das Finanças\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span lang=\"pt-PT\">Ministério das Finanças</span></span></a></span> above the previous report, including <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"ppp-oe2027-riscos-brisa\" class=\"claim-value\">1 122,5</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/ppp-oe2027-riscos-brisa\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Ministério das Finanças\" title=\"Ministério das Finanças\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span lang=\"pt-PT\">Ministério das Finanças</span></span></a></span> from Brisa, in the ongoing negotiation, and <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"ppp-oe2027-riscos-rotas-algarve-principal\" class=\"claim-value\">445</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/ppp-oe2027-riscos-rotas-algarve-principal\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Ministério das Finanças\" title=\"Ministério das Finanças\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span lang=\"pt-PT\">Ministério das Finanças</span></span></a></span> in the main action by Rotas do Algarve Litoral, in which Infraestruturas de Portugal pays, by provisional decision, around <span class=\"claim claim-com-chip\"><span data-claim=\"ppp-oe2027-riscos-rotas-algarve-mensal\" class=\"claim-value\">1,3</span><span class=\"claim-sufixo\"> million</span><a class=\"src-chip\" href=\"/en/ledger/ppp-oe2027-riscos-rotas-algarve-mensal\" data-nonledger=\"proveniencia\" data-selo-etiqueta=\"Ministério das Finanças\" title=\"Ministério das Finanças\"><span class=\"src-chip-texto\">source</span><span class=\"vh\"> · <span lang=\"pt-PT\">Ministério das Finanças</span></span></a></span> a month, plus VAT. The UTAO distinguishes claims from actual charges: «<a class=\"discussao-literal\" href=\"https://app.parlamento.pt/webutils/docs/doc.pdf?path=jXG0%2bDjqO%2fp24sKDn5FOWu7PztWEWehzpjBISfq%2bHBtO6CBEhPZcSa90e7P%2fEmuAirgdFc3uJ4AGHFGQz2ubmRHqIldswZvo4iG1rB8JkFdli%2bE%2b5pF7oAwuJr8C7utVPOh60GxHq8Dubj%2bAdy%2bfyHAcsqPX1u5E8MfUhNBiJZ3RXzFuyvv2o42Tg6o2xFCYvAHMzy%2fUJ6tdI8QCvqt13kcfQpd5lggsIcipfZ634nqHaBBebtywj7T9%2fatfLzpF%2f23WTlGF27nnlPWdE6EX%2fuXRp0W01R2qnbhElWeTDfJpVM2OwqoVmUrHDWhwdYoYgsbC0ZiVEkty%2bSS4oorZGF7d36ELrrmQzWsXI4671ROkNVrsg3EYXrY2YcUFP%2bDR0BSMGe3cyGx1BV%2bdxPbSwDriMMnzyX9Gma1KrrYmjsC0FEk%2fX1GL9Ns4N1JLVZOUSHzYhkXb7UtLAlhSpTP1tRutoSrfJqmMLBk6poYIIVQ5SHLnPIxaJMun7gsC0gMHgRLAGq3C%2fUjGEu0U%2bELEMg%3d%3d&amp;fich=UTAO-Rel-17-2026-OE2027_preliminar.pdf&amp;Inline=true\" data-discussao-literal=\"excerpt\"><span class=\"campo-valor\" lang=\"pt-PT\" data-linha-claim=\"utao-ppp-con